rem Range Flips
rem https://projecteuler.net/problem=430

use numbers
use sequences
use io
use cli

option N integer = 10000000000
option M integer = 4000
option Digits integer = 2
option Edge integer = 30000000

rem Disk i stays white with chance
rem (1 + r^M) / 2 with r = ((N + 1 -
rem 2 i)^2 - 2 N + 1) / N^2. Only
rem disks near the ends have r^M that
rem matters, so a huge N sums two
rem symmetric edges of Edge disks.
Cnt = N
Fac = 1
if N greater 2 * Edge
  Cnt = Edge
  Fac = 2
end
Is = (1 to Cnt) copy
Xs = (N + 1) * 1.0 - 2.0 * Is
Nf = N * 1.0
Qs = Xs * Xs - 2.0 * Nf + 1.0
Rs = Qs / Nf / Nf
Ps = (Rs ** M) copy
E = N / 2.0 + Fac * (Ps sum) / 2.0
Answer = E round Digits
Answer print
